@startuml UC-70 Update Content Comment - Sequence Diagram (icon)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.10.2.8 UC-70 Update Content Comment — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
boundary ":CommunityHubDetailPage" as UI
control ":HubContentController" as CTL
control ":HubCommentService" as SVC
boundary ":HubCommentRepository" as REPO
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Edit" on one of their own comments
activate UI
UI ->> UI : startEditComment(item)
UI -->> Teacher : Show the comment in inline edit mode with its current text
Teacher ->> UI : Edit the comment text and click "Save"
UI ->> UI : requestSaveEditComment(item)
UI -->> Teacher : Show the save confirmation dialog
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Save changes" to confirm
UI ->> UI : saveEditComment()
UI ->> CTL : PATCH /api/hub/comments/{commentId}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : update(commentId, content)
activate SVC

SVC ->> REPO : findById(commentId)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM hub_content_comments WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : row / none
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : HubComment
deactivate REPO

alt the comment is missing or hidden, the user is not its author, or the new text is empty or over 200 words
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException / IllegalArgumentException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403 / 400
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG25 and keep the edited text in the inline editor

else the user owns the comment and the new text is valid
  SVC ->> SVC : sanitize the new text, keep createdAt and set updatedAt to now
  SVC ->> REPO : save(comment)
  activate REPO
  REPO ->> DB : UPDATE hub_content_comments SET content = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> REPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  REPO -->> SVC : HubComment
  deactivate REPO
  SVC -->> CTL : HubCommentView
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + HubCommentView
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG08 and the updated comment in the discussion
end

deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
